#: ../../../ReleaseNotes.md:909
msgid ""
"Parameters declared with a `decltype` are now presented as the type the "
"`decltype` resolves to, e.g. `set_x(int val)` rather than `set_x(decltype(x) "
"val)`. This affects the completion strings produced by libclang as well as "
"those used by clangd."
